Composery Dark / Composery Light are the default color themes, including
the first-paint frame.

ThemeSettingDefaults.COLOR_THEME_DARK/LIGHT select the defaults. The
COLOR_THEME_*_INITIAL_COLORS blocks are upstream's synchronous first-paint
snapshot: themes load asynchronously from extension JSON, but the workbench
needs colors on frame one, so upstream hardcodes its default themes' colors
there. This patch retints the snapshot with the composery-themes values; keys
the themes do not define keep upstream's line (they resolve to upstream
defaults at runtime too). Hand-maintained like every other patch - the
"default color theme" tests in tests/code-server-patches.test.ts fail if these
values drift from the theme JSONs.

